(2 \* N \* 50) / (2 \* 0.15) = 1200

Solving for N, we get:

N = 1200 / (2 \* 50) / (2 \* 0.15)

N = 1200 / 100 / 0.15

N = 1200 / 15

N = 80

So, the no-load speed is 80 rpm.

